{"step_index":96,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T03:13:48Z","thinking":"The Excel file's structure has been retrieved, showing two sheets. The analysis now shifts to inspecting the '기업 정보' sheet, focusing on its column headers (row 1), the number of non-empty rows, and identifying rows authored by '배현명'. This necessitates developing a script to perform these specific analyses on the data.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"node -e \\\"\\nconst ExcelJS = require('exceljs');\\nasync function run() {\\n  const workbook = new ExcelJS.Workbook();\\n  const filePath = 'C:\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\lg\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\오늘\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명.xlsx';\\n  await workbook.xlsx.readFile(filePath);\\n  const sheet = workbook.getWorksheet('기업 정보');\\n  \\n  const headers = [];\\n  sheet.getRow(1).eachCell({ includeEmpty: true }, (c, col) => {\\n    headers[col] = c.value;\\n  });\\n  console.log('Headers count:', headers.length);\\n  console.log('Headers:', headers.filter(Boolean));\\n  \\n  let totalDataRows = 0;\\n  const authorCounts = {};\\n  \\n  for (let r = 2; r <= sheet.rowCount; r++) {\\n    const row = sheet.getRow(r);\\n    const author = row.getCell(1).value;\\n    const company = row.getCell(3).value;\\n    const bizno = row.getCell(4).value;\\n    if (!author && !company && !bizno) continue;\\n    \\n    totalDataRows++;\\n    const authKey = String(author || '미지정').trim();\\n    authorCounts[authKey] = (authorCounts[authKey] || 0) + 1;\\n  }\\n  \\n  console.log('Total non-empty data rows:', totalDataRows);\\n  console.log('Author counts:', authorCounts);\\n}\\nrun().catch(console.error);\\n\\\"\"","Cwd":"\"c:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\resilient-bardeen\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"3000","toolAction":"\"Analyzing Excel file contents\"","toolSummary":"\"Analyze data rows and authors\""}}]}
{"step_index":97,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-08-31T03:13:50Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-31T12:13:50+09:00\nTool is running as a background task with task id: ee5104b6-03e7-4ad7-9556-78ec00557d2c/task-97\nTask Description: node -e \"\nconst ExcelJS = require('exceljs');\nasync function run() {\n  const workbook = new ExcelJS.Workbook();\n  const filePath = 'C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\lg\\\\\\\\Desktop\\\\\\\\오늘\\\\\\\\(데이터검증팀)실사 DB 취합_전달용_260720_배현명.xlsx';\n  await workbook.xlsx.readFile(filePath);\n  const sheet = workbook.getWorksheet('기업 정보');\n  \n  const headers = [];\n  sheet.getRow(1).eachCell({ includeEmpty: true }, (c, col) => {\n    headers[col] = c.value;\n  });\n  console.log('Headers count:', headers.length);\n  console.log('Headers:', headers.filter(Boolean));\n  \n  let totalDataRows = 0;\n  const authorCounts = {};\n  \n  for (let r = 2; r <= sheet.rowCount; r++) {\n    const row = sheet.getRow(r);\n    const author = row.getCell(1).value;\n    const company = row.getCell(3).value;\n    const bizno = row.getCell(4).value;\n    if (!author && !company && !bizno) continue;\n    \n    totalDataRows++;\n    const authKey = String(author || '미지정').trim();\n    authorCounts[authKey] = (authorCounts[authKey] || 0) + 1;\n  }\n  \n  console.log('Total non-empty data rows:', totalDataRows);\n  console.log('Author counts:', authorCounts);\n}\nrun().catch(console.error);\n\"\nTask logs are available at: file:///C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/brain/ee5104b6-03e7-4ad7-9556-78ec00557d2c/.system_generated/tasks/task-97.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE."}
